  unitNumber: 638
  description: A guardian weapon that can move autonomously which has a number of
    defense mechanisms controlled by its core. This rarely found guardian weapon
    has in essence come to disregard all its initial functions, and achieved evolution
    for the purpose of disposing of anything it considers hostile. It is believed
    that it was modified by someone for some particular purpose, but now it is nothing
    more but a machine which attacks anything that approaches it. Without a soul,
    and without a conscience, it has brought countless of warriors to their deaths.
